Package: rpi-fake-sleep
Version: 1.2.4
Architecture: all
Maintainer: GamingTux <gamingtux@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/GamingTux/argon-oneup-suite
Depends: python3, python3-gi, systemd
Description: Universal Userspace Sleep & Standby Manager for Raspberry Pi
 Enables native low-power sleep and standby on Raspberry Pi 5 / CM5 systems
 where the platform firmware lacks ACPI S3 or hardware s2idle support.
 Integrates seamlessly with systemd-suspend and systemd-logind to handle lid
 close events, desktop sleep actions, cgroups v2 process freezing, single-core
 CPU parking (C1-C3 in hardware WFI), USB 2.0 host/audio autosuspend, and
 instant <1ms wakeup via keyboard or lid switch.
